<title>AUSTRALIA: CBA launches transferable CD programme.</title>
<headline>CBA launches transferable CD programme.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commonwealth Bank of Australia (CBA) said on Thursday it had established a transferable certificate of deposit (TCD) programme which would enable it to issue TCDs into the wholesale domestic market.</p>
<p>The programme would be continuously offered to allow investors access to high quality bank risk, the CBA said in a statement.</p>
</text>
